        		<script language="javascript" type="text/javascript">
        	function checkChildren(srcObj, vType) {
        		for (var i = 0; i < eval("document.formSMC." + vType + ".length"); i++) {
        			if ((eval("document.formSMC." + vType + "[i].value.substring(0, srcObj.length)") == srcObj) && (eval("document.formSMC." + vType + "[i].disabled") == false)) {
        					(eval("document.formSMC." + vType + "[i].checked")) ? eval("document.formSMC." + vType + "[i]").checked = false : eval("document.formSMC." + vType + "[i]").checked = true;
        			}
        		}
        		return false;
        	}
        function toggleRepealed(element) {
        	const rows = document.getElementById("hideRepealed").querySelectorAll('tr');
        	rows.forEach(function (row) {
        		var text = row.textContent;		
        		if (text.includes('REPEALED') && !row.classList.contains('hidden')) {
        			row.classList.add('hidden')
        		}
        		else {
        			row.classList.remove('hidden')
        		}
        	})
        }
        function HideRepealed() {
        	const rows = document.getElementById("hideRepealed").querySelectorAll('tr');
        	rows.forEach(function (row) {
        		var text = row.textContent;		
        		if (text.includes('REPEALED') && !row.classList.contains('hidden')) {
        			row.classList.add('hidden')
        		}
        	})
        }
        </script>
        <div style="padding: 15px;"><form action="/smc/" method="post" name="formSMC">
        <div id="hideRepealed">
        		<p><a href="/smc/?Title=06">Title 06</a> Intergovernmental Operations</p>
        				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=06.01">Chapter 06.01</a> Airport Board</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.01.010">Section 06.01.010</a> Establishment<br />
        <p>Pursuant to RCW 14.08.200, there is established through an agreement between the City and Spokane County the Spokane airport board.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.01.020">Section 06.01.020</a> Powers and Functions<br />
        <p>To the board is delegated operation of Spokane International Airport, Felts Field, and Spokane International Airport Business Park in accordance with the Municipal Airports Act of 1945, as amended (chapter 14.08 RCW), as provided by interlocal agreement.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=06.03">Chapter 06.03</a> Employment and Training Consortium (Spokane Area Workforce Development Council Administration)</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.03.010">Section 06.03.010</a> Establishment<br />
        <p>In accordance with chapter 39.34 RCW, there is established through an interlocal cooperation agreement between the City and Spokane County the Spokane city/county employment and training consortium.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.03.020">Section 06.03.020</a> Powers and Functions<br />
        <p>The consortium acts as the administrative entity for the Spokane workforce development area which is comprised of all of Spokane County. As such it executes grant agreements for the purpose of conducting employment and training programs for citizens of Spokane County under the Workforce Investment Act of 1998 (P.L. 105-220, August 7, 1998), regulations promulgated thereunder by the secretary of labor and rules provided by the governor.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=06.04">Chapter 06.04</a> Health District</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.04.010">Section 06.04.010</a> Participation by City<br />
        <p>The City is part of the Spokane County health district as evidenced and specified by agreement.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.04.020">Section 06.04.020</a> Local Health Officer<br />
        <p>All rights, powers and responsibilities granted to and imposed upon local health boards, departments and officers by law, including the ordinances of the City, are delegated to and devolve upon the Spokane County health district.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=06.05">Chapter 06.05</a> REPEALED (Historic Landmarks Commission)</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.010">Section 06.05.010</a> REPEALED (Findings and Purpose)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.010">SMC 17D.040.010</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.020">Section 06.05.020</a> REPEALED (Definitions)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17A.020">chapter 17A.020 SMC</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.030">Section 06.05.030</a> REPEALED (Establishment – Membership)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.020">SMC 17D.040.020</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.040">Section 06.05.040</a> REPEALED (Terms – Appointment)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.030">SMC 17D.040.030</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.060">Section 06.05.060</a> REPEALED (Compensation)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.040">SMC 17D.040.040</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.070">Section 06.05.070</a> REPEALED (Rules and Regulations)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.050">SMC 17D.040.050</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.080">Section 06.05.080</a> REPEALED (Funding)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.060">SMC 17D.040.060</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.090">Section 06.05.090</a> REPEALED (Commission Staff)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.070">SMC 17D.040.070</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.100">Section 06.05.100</a> REPEALED (Duties)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.080">SMC 17D.040.080</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.110">Section 06.05.110</a> REPEALED (Historic Landmark and Historic District – Designation)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.090">SMC 17D.040.090</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.120">Section 06.05.120</a> REPEALED (Historic Landmark and Historic District – Nomination Process)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.100">SMC 17D.040.100</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.130">Section 06.05.130</a> REPEALED (Historic Landmark and Historic District – Submittal Process)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.110">SMC 17D.040.110</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.180">Section 06.05.180</a> REPEALED (Procedure – Preliminary Designation)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.120">SMC 17D.040.120</a>.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 16, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Saturday, June 2, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C34012 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=06.05.190">Section 06.05.190</a> REPEALED (Procedure – Findings of Fact)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C33575. </p>
        <p>Renumbered to <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17D.040.130">SMC 17D.040.130</a>.</p>
